---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+19195550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(919) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Frozen AC Coil | AC Repair Wake Forest NC" description="Frozen evaporator coil repair in Wake Forest, NC. Why it happens and how we fix it.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Frozen AC Coil</h1>
      <p>Frozen evaporator coil repair in Wake Forest, NC. Why it happens and how we fix it.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:800px">
      <p>Ice on the indoor coil blocks airflow and can damage the compressor if the system keeps running. Common causes are low refrigerant (leak), dirty filters, restricted airflow, or a failing blower.</p>
      <p>We safely thaw the system, locate the underlying cause, repair leaks if present, and restore proper operation.</p>
      <h2>Get Help Today</h2>
      <p>Don't wait in the heat. Call <a href={`tel:${phone}`}>(919) 555-0199</a> for same-day diagnosis and repair in Wake Forest, Rolesville, and surrounding areas.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:1.5rem"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call (919) 555-0199</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>